   "text": "ArcGIS REST Services Directory Login\nHome > services > RIDEM > Outdoor_Recreation_Map_v4 (MapServer) > DEM Managed Recreational Land Help | API Reference\nJSON\nLayer: DEM Managed Recreational Land (ID: 21)\nName: DEM Managed Recreational Land\nDisplay Field: NAME\nType: Feature Layer\nGeometry Type: esriGeometryPolygon\nDescription: Approximate edges of Conservation Lands protected by the State of Rhode Island through Fee Title Ownership, Conservation Easement, or Deed Restriction. Includes: Wildlife Management Areas, Drinking Water Supply Watersheds, State Parks, Beaches, Bike Paths, Fishing Access Areas, Local Parks and Recreation Facilities that have been developed with State Grant Funds.\nCopyright Text:\nDefault Visibility: true\nMaxRecordCount: 2000\nSupported Query Formats: JSON, geoJSON, PBF\nMin Scale: 0\nMax Scale: 0\nSupports Advanced Queries: true\nSupports Statistics: true\nHas Labels: false\nCan Modify Layer: true\nCan Scale Symbols: false\nUse Standardized Queries: true\nSupports Datum Transformation: true\nExtent:\nXMin: -8001232.333977901\nYMin: 5033862.323453109\nXMax: -7916779.574930627\nYMax: 5163781.00500943\nSpatial Reference: 102100 (3857)\nDrawing Info:\nRenderer:\nUnique Value Renderer:\nField 1: PrimUse\nField 2: N/A\nField 3: N/A\nField Delimiter: ,\nDefault Symbol:\nN/A\nDefault Label: N/A\nUniqueValueInfos:\nValue: Bikeway\nLabel: Bikeway\nDescription: N/A\nSymbol:\nStyle: esriSFSSolid\nColor: [245, 112, 86, 255]\nOutline:\nN/A\nValue: BikewayUndev\nLabel: Bikeway (Undeveloped)\nDescription: N/A\nSymbol:\nStyle: esriSFSSolid\nColor: [220, 232, 90, 255]\nOutline:\nN/A\nValue: Commercial Fishing Port\nLabel: Commercial Fishing Port\nDescription: N/A\nSymbol:\nStyle: esriSFSSolid\nColor: [138, 62, 87, 255]\nOutline:\nN/A\nValue: Conservation\nLabel: Conservation\nDescription: N/A\nSymbol:\nStyle: esriSFSSolid\nColor: [143, 117, 51, 255]\nOutline:\nN/A\nValue: Fishing Access\nLabel: Fishing Access\nDescription: N/A\nSymbol:\nSt